OL,3,GNEWSASix police officers sacked after
OL,4,Aracism probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix serving police officers have been
OL,7,Fsacked following an internal
OL,8,Finvestigation by Greater Manchester
OL,9,FPolice into alleged racial
OL,10,Fdiscrimination against a fellow
OL,11,Fofficer.
OL,13,FGMP said two other former officers who
OL,14,Fwere also investigated would have been
OL,15,Ffired if they were still on the force.
OL,16,FAnother officer received written
OL,17,Fwarning.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
