OL,3,GNEWSASix police officers sacked after
OL,4,Aracism probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force disciplinary panel heard the
OL,7,Ffemale officer of African heritage (who
OL,8,Fwas not named in the proceedings)
OL,9,Fcomplained after her accent was
OL,10,Fmimicked by a group of officers.
OL,12,FShe was also compared to a suspect with
OL,13,Fsimilar skin colour, while one officer
OL,14,Fmade a derogatory comment about her
OL,15,Fhair.
